          "url": "/c/4-week-butterfly-ctb-pull-up-programming/sections/579024/lessons/2182138",
          "description": "If you’re reading this, you’ve already got 20+ butterfly pull-ups and at least 10 kipping chest-to-bar pull-ups under your belt — which means you’re ready for Butterfly Chest-to-Bar Pull-ups! If you’re not quite there yet, we recommend starting with the Butterfly Pull-up Breakthrough course to build your foundation first. In this lesson, we’ll begin grooving this new movement pattern and dialling in the positions needed to successfully complete butterfly chest to bars. At the end of the session, you’ll complete baseline videos. Be sure to review them, compare your form to the demo video, and ask yourself: How would I rate my form and efficiency?",
